s betritt sie eine Welt voller sprechender Tiere, Magie und uralter M\u00e4chte. Als die beiden in einen Konflikt geraten, der das Gleichgewicht des Waldes bedroht, entdeckt Prue eine innere St\u00e4rke, von der sie niemals geahnt h\u00e4tte, dass sie in ihr steckt. Wenn sie ihren Bruder retten und das Schicksal von Wildwood ver\u00e4ndern will, muss sie alles aufs Spiel setzen.\r\n\r\n","contentRating":{"minimumAge":12},"productionCountries":[{"name":"Canada"},{"name":"United Kingdom"},{"name":"United States"}],"genres":[{"name":"Animation"},{"name":"Abenteuer"},{"name":"Fantasy"}],"directors":[{"name":"Travis Knight"}],"actors":[{"name":"Peyton Elizabeth Lee"},{"name":"Jacob Tremblay"},{"name":"Carey Mulligan"},{"name":"Mahershala Ali"},{"name":"Arthur Knight"},{"name":"Angela Bassett"},{"name":"Awkwafina"},{"name":"Jake Johnson"},{"name":"Charlie Day"},{"name":"Amandla Stenberg"},{"name":"Jemaine Clement"},{"name":"Maya Erskine"},{"name":"Tantoo Cardinal"},{"name":"Tom Waits"},{"name":"Richard E. Grant"},{"name":"\u00d3lafur Darri \u00d3lafsson"},{"name":"Blythe Danner"},{"name":"Rob Delaney"},{"name":"Marc Evan Jackson"},{"name":"Len Cariou"}],"thumbnailImage":{"url":"https:\/\/static.kinoheld.de\/images\/film\/wildwood-109101.v17895350415249.jpg"},"trailers":[{"url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=4QlEVeMP4WE"}]}},{"name":"BTS WORLD TOUR 'ARIRANG' IN S\u00c3O PAULO: LIVE VIEWING","beginning":"2026-10-31T18:30:00+01:00","urlSlug":"6acb1002026bf6041eaa4eae","deeplink":"https:\/\/buchung.uci-kinowelt.de\/?perf_id=FAE76000023JHWJXVF&site_id=46","flags":[],"subtitleLanguage":null,"auditorium":{"name":"Saal 1"},"cinema":{"urlSlug":"uci-kinowelt-ruhr-park","city":{"urlSlug":"bochum"}},"movie":{"id":"108757","title":"BTS WORLD TOUR 'ARIRANG' IN S\u00c3O PAULO: LIVE VIEWING","titleOriginal":"BTS WORLD TOUR 'ARIRANG' IN S\u00c3O PAULO: LIVE VIEWING","urlSlug":"bts-world-tour-arirang-in-sao-paulo-live-viewing","duration":195,"productionYear":"2026","description":"BTS 